Package: superfastgsea
Title: Super Fast Gene Set Enrichment Analysis with Rust Backend
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jiahe", "Zheng", , "jiahe@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: High-performance Gene Set Enrichment Analysis (GSEA) using a Rust
    backend with Gamma distribution approximation. Achieves 10-50x speedup
    compared to fgsea while maintaining statistical accuracy through anchor
    sampling and parallel computation via rayon.
